---
// Home section 2: the two pillars. Two-column split with a hairline divider.
---

<section class="pillars" aria-labelledby="pillars-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="section-eyebrow" id="pillars-heading">What we build</p>
    <div class="pillars-grid">
      <article class="pillar">
        <p class="pillar-index" aria-hidden="true">01</p>
        <h2 class="pillar-title">AI products</h2>
        <p>
          Software that puts language models to real work. PRISM reads a
          repository's history and explains what each commit meant. Spec2Run
          turns a typed description into a deployed API with its tests passing.
        </p>
        <p class="pillar-links">
          <a href="/products/prism">PRISM</a>
          <a href="/products/spec2run">Spec2Run</a>
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="pillar">
        <p class="pillar-index" aria-hidden="true">02</p>
        <h2 class="pillar-title">Full-stack applications</h2>
        <p>
          APIs, dashboards, and infrastructure you can run. The Contract
          Firewall learns your API's schemas from live traffic. promostack
          puts coupons, gift cards, and referrals behind one API.
        </p>
        <p class="pillar-links">
          <a href="/products/api-contract-firewall">API Contract Firewall</a>
          <a href="/products/promostack">promostack</a>
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
